      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"An additional \"power user\" option could also be that users can add more \"trusted URLs\" through the config JSON.\"\n\nThis needs to also be present in the client itself, not only JSON. \n\nQuest users need this ability too.\n\nThis could go very well together with Debug Menu that shows which Untrusted URLs the world is trying to use. A button next to that URL to Trust it would work great.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
