      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would definitely love to see something like this implemented. Being able to change the whitelist of \"trusted URLs\" could be a good start as well like what miner28_3 said, but with emphasis on being able to create your own list and a separate default list. Some times you don't want to have to deal with a youtube video loading.",
