      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There should definitely be the ability to see what kind of URLs are being requested, and maybe the ability to set URL filters for what is auto allows and auto disallowed.  Ie, \"*.discord.com\" most people probably feel safe to add to the auto allow list, but not \"*.evilsite.hahah.youre.pwned\" would definitely go on the disallowed list if it popped up.",
